{"ld": 1731, "paper": "SP677", "session": "132", "title": "An Act to Increase the Influence of the Maine State Ferry Advisory Board on the Funding and Operations of the Maine State Ferry Service", "sponsor_id": "s-grohoski-nicole", "cosponsor_ids": ["s-beebe-center-anne", "s-curry-glenn", "h-eaton-holly", "h-faulkingham-william", "h-geiger-valli", "h-matlack-ann", "s-moore-marianne", "h-ray-d"], "committee_code": "TRA", "committee_name": "Transportation", "summary": {"text": "This bill requires the Maine State Ferry Service to consult with the Maine State Ferry Advisory Board on matters regarding budgets, strategic planning and major operational decisions. Recommendations made by the board regarding certain matters must be considered by the Maine State Ferry Service during its decision-making processes for the following fiscal year. The bill requires the Maine State Ferry Service to provide regular reports to the board and requires the board to review and provide feedback and recommendations. The bill also requires the board to conduct an annual review of the Maine State Ferry Service's performance and operations and provide a report to the joint standing committee of the Legislature having jurisdiction over transportation matters by January 15th of each year.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0677&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "vetoed", "status_label": "Veto Sustained", "final_disposition": {"label": "Veto Sustained", "date": "2025-06-25", "governor_action": "Veto", "governor_action_date": "2025-06-23"}, "fiscal_status": "No Fiscal Impact", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 1731)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0677&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (S-339)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0677&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (S-339)", "description": "Change Title", "spon